{"en": "1047330857", "title": "COMMENT CRÉER DES ÉCHANTILLONS ENFANTS", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "279b00802a10"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La quatrième étape est la"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Child Sample Creation. ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Elle consiste à créer des aliquotes à partir de l'échantillon parent pour l'analyse interne. Sélectionnez les échantillons parents et indiquez le nombre d'échantillons enfants à créer pour chaque parent."}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "6a237a77b539", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "edb9273263c9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "af063a852375"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Child Sample Creation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072355.png", "id": "46dabee9-93b3-4f02-bb9b-47ba39ed0e1f", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "b8a195c3302f", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "f301c41786c6"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1ef601d5faa2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cette section permet aussi de définir la destination des échantillons : acheminement interne pour l'analyse proprement dite, vers un laboratoire externe ou encore vers le stockage."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072417.png", "id": "d1f82a5a-4301-46f7-8e78-3051a7050bed", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "3ef213223f1e", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "f148ad75122f", "order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "dbfa142a877d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d4344e4dd08d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez quelques échantillons."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072442.png", "id": "a567c8bc-0e30-46bc-9f9a-00177f01af8a", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "9fe16f4317c7", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "703540524015", "order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4eed7720d820"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3636a051139b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Create Children ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "pour les échantillons sélectionnés"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072511.png", "id": "fe0fbc3e-aba6-4672-9591-82337e2ff77a", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "8378af829028", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "ef037c1a6083", "order": 4}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7cc5404e75d6"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "02ffc3764f7a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Indiquez le nombre d'échantillons enfants par échantillon parent. Utilisez le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "+", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour augmenter le nombre et le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "-", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour le diminuer."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072528.png", "id": "82482807-6a7d-4bd7-a9f3-78238e902426", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "1318402138c3", "height": 234}}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "cfd842e63f5c", "order": 5}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "70fdcbff4383"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "70f3f3a97358"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Définissez les identifiants des échantillons enfants. Dans cet exemple, l'identifiant indique la date ainsi que le numéro de l'aliquote. Au total, 4 échantillons enfants sont créés."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072551.png", "id": "a2b1cc9b-7a0d-42bd-a74a-117e82effbdd", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "63655544b395", "height": 234}}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "bc32fec0fabc", "order": 6}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "e348b53e6f4e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0b0c1d97dd9e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Create Children", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-074018.png", "id": "062039c0-0a1a-4700-acf5-b16907fa396a", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "88bcc1f17643", "height": 234}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3fb27458acc7"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8438cd9fe6be"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lorsque vous cliquez sur le bouton Create Children, les échantillons enfants sont créés. Notez que le"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Statut", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Status", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") est Pending."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072625.png", "id": "14f4b148-becf-4d0e-a797-80193be99ca0", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "0f3b84871557", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "6fd4533011d0", "order": 7}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "28dffc4389ff"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4f63124e6dfe"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Terminez la création des échantillons enfants en les sélectionnant. Dans cet exemple, deux aliquotes d'un échantillon parent sont sélectionnées, ainsi que d'autres échantillons qui n'ont pas nécessairement d'aliquotes"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072701.png", "id": "f05492ba-7a8a-4f87-a74d-47d7e5dae613", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "6681861c4604", "height": 233}}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "3a9b8277c0f1", "order": 8}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "89411573e769"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b8a44d4b136e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mark Aliqouting Complete", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072806.png", "id": "f0d4c378-471e-4835-99f0-8be707b5a01c", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "a16e488deaf7", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "ecbf95f0863b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c533a4bfe6f3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le statut passe à « terminé »."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072822.png", "id": "9dd4d8aa-f8ce-46df-b0dd-399feb0bc882", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "1aa185f1d0b1", "height": 231}}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "4f66f86fef86"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "82d652bd86ba"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si un échantillon parent a plusieurs aliquotes et que vous devez en afficher la hiérarchie, cliquez sur l'icône en forme d'œil."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-072905.png", "id": "24f88021-6f19-4f3f-bf07-696fcd666641", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "f0e2e42dc501", "height": 231}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "c0a9564077b0"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1c1f2e2fcee8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La hiérarchie s'affiche."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-073054.png", "id": "189ac2bd-c60c-434f-b0dc-dfc8197cd480", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "c83f9a513f6f", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "0d2fef5a6dd5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5bfa42c399c1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Faites défiler la page jusqu'à la section Sample Routing."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-073324.png", "id": "a085d9ba-9c7f-4cdc-b3e0-ba79f0a28e4a", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "4b61c1d3c2c3", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "de5a3625ce8b", "order": 9}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7a5e4ae9b42e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dfff37b505f1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Actualiser", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Refresh", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") si aucun échantillon n'est disponible pour l'acheminement alors que l'aliquotage est terminé."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-073343.png", "id": "33889556-72ea-42b6-bbca-62d846fb053b", "collection": "contentId-1047330857", "type": "file", "localId": "b1d2bf4f306d", "height": 232}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs